touts principaux\n\nAllie nature, confort et proximité urbaine.\n\nEspaces extérieurs généreux pour tous les logements.\n\nPrestations haut de gamme et cadre de vie raffiné.\n\nAdresse rare dans un quartier calme et recherché à proximité immédiate de Paris.","addr":"8/12 rue de la Marne","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjhlMmI2NjI2YmVhNWU5MjgzZWZlMWU1YjMxMWQ0OTY2YTE3NWQ1YmUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIyNzRiY2U4OGY5OGQ1MTljOTVhYjQ1N2NjNDZlNTBjMCJ9?signature=cbd5bbe026e5fe28b972bbc545ea0ef1533250a37f8b4f70784eefefe10f35f7","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImE2M2YzYTI5NDdhMjljZTJhMjc5ZDJiZDI5OTcwZmVjOWU0ZTZjMWQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI2M2E3YTEzOGJkMWNhNWNhMTY0NTFjY2RhOWQzYmFkMCJ9?signature=8999280ee45a0f8a3cc47c737869aefb2c1612367f6e42634107b515c6094fdc","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijk3NDZlZDMxNDcwYTVjOGY0OTU3NDU4Y2JiM2Q0MjU0Y2QzMTBjMTkiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI2YTEwYjI3Zjk1NGUyOGU5YjM2YmFmMzNmYWY0Yjc2NSJ9?signature=d6beae4551057f079a6c316897d527c08dd889b7a6253ab88c47ae6989b13a31"],"yt":[],"vr":["https://imdg3d.com/Apps/Maquette_Villa_Marnea"],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182N2Q0NDA5OTBiMzcyNS40MjcyMTQwNiIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6ODUsImhlaWdodCI6ODUsImZpdCI6ImNvdmVyIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182N2Q0NDA5OTBiMzYzMi4xNDEwMzQ0OSJ9?signature=34eea7ac68b149a4809dca5e95be4f6bedec10952f767e8269aafbe35d99831d","zone":"A BIS","lots":[{"ty":"T2","na":"Appartement","s":40.04,"f":"1","ex":["O"],"ter":2.84,"pk":1,"pr":[{"tva":5.5,"p":249000.0},{"tva":20.0,"p":283223.0}],"op